<section class="page">
    <h1 class="page-title">About Me</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">
        Jay Bell — CTO &amp; Co-Founder of Trellis.org, Angular GDE, Nx Champion, podcaster.
    </p>

    <div class="prose-jay">
        <p>
            I'm the CTO and Co-Founder of
            <a href="https://trellis.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Trellis.org</a>, a social
            enterprise working to empower global collective impact. I've been steering Trellis's technical
            direction since its inception in 2018.
        </p>
        <p>
            Born and raised in Canada, I've dabbled in various entrepreneurial ventures, from drones to
            software and mobile apps. My passion for technology and innovation led me to co-found Trellis.org.
            I specialize in Nx, Angular, Nest, DevOps, CI/CD, startups, TypeScript, GraphQL, and NgRx — and
            I'm an active open-source contributor.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="sec-header" id="things">
        <span class="sec-title">Things I do</span>
        <div class="sec-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="thing-grid">
        <div class="thing-item">
            <div class="thing-org">Podcast</div>
            <div class="thing-title">The Angular Plus Show</div>
            <div class="thing-detail">The home of ng-conf's official all-Angular podcast. Listen on Spotify.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="thing-item">
            <div class="thing-org">Hobby</div>
            <div class="thing-title">Horde 40k app</div>
            <div class="thing-detail">Warhammer 40k companion app built with Angular and Nx.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="thing-item">
            <div class="thing-org">Community</div>
            <div class="thing-title">Angular GDE / Nx Champion</div>
            <div class="thing-detail">Helping grow the Angular and Nx communities through talks and open source.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="thing-item">
            <div class="thing-org">Work</div>
            <div class="thing-title">Trellis</div>
            <div class="thing-detail">
                Building software that has to hold up when it matters most.
                <a href="https://tech.trellis.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Read the Trellis Tech Blog →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="thing-item">
            <div class="thing-org">Show</div>
            <div class="thing-title">This is Tech Talks</div>
            <div class="thing-detail">A show about tech, software, and the people building it.</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sec-header" id="links">
        <span class="sec-title">Find me</span>
        <div class="sec-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="link-list">
        {% for link in links %}
            <div class="link-list__item">
                <span class="link-list__label">{{ link.label }}</span>
                <span class="link-list__desc">
                    <a href="{{ link.href }}" {% if link.href | isExternal %}target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"{% endif %}>{{ link.text }}</a>
                    {% if link.note %} — {{ link.note }}{% endif %}
                </span>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>
